{"metadata":{"title":"The Secret Map","author":"AI","language":"English","difficulty":"A1"},"content":[["Tom likes","old things.","He has","a small house","near the forest.","One day,","Tom finds","an old box","under his bed.","He opens","the box.","Inside","there is","an old paper.","It is","a map.","The map shows","a big tree","in the dark woods.","Tom is","very happy.","He takes","a flashlight","and goes outside."],["The night","is dark.","The wind","blows softly.","Tom walks","into the trees.","He looks","at the map.","Ten steps","to the left,","five steps","to the right.","He stops","near a big oak.","He sees","something shiny","on the ground.","It is","a small metal key.","Tom smiles","and runs back","to his warm home."],["What opens","this key?","He looks around","his room.","He tries","the key","on the old box","from before.","Click!","The box opens","again.","Inside is","a gold coin","and a red ruby.","Tom is","amazed.","His adventure","is just","beginning."]]}